{"id":1050902,"chapter_id":1050902,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"N.F.115年 数日后\n\n下午16点整\n\nMBCC管理局，会客室","style":9,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"你进入了会客室中。一进门便看到了被几名护工围在中间的老人。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"他身体干枯瘦削，躺在仪器的包围之中。数根针管插入他的身体各处的血管，延续着生命，心电图发出平静且稳定的滴滴声。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"一名紫衣女子走到了使团最前面，彬彬有礼地伸出了手，与你相握，开口便是还算流利的狄斯话——","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902005,"trial_step":5},{"step":5,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"您好，局长，感谢您百忙之中抽出时间见我们一面。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902006,"trial_step":6},{"step":6,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"我叫魏紫衣，是东洲药坊恒云堂的管事人。这位是我的族曾祖父，魏伟肖先生，他创办了我们药坊。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902007,"trial_step":7},{"step":7,"content":"看你愣了愣，她淡然解释道。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902008,"trial_step":8},{"step":8,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"族曾祖父，也就是我曾祖父的兄弟。他终生未娶，将我视为己出，悉心培养，接管恒云堂。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902009,"trial_step":9},{"step":9,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"在藤萝狂厄事件中，杜若老师也特意拜访我们药坊，探讨解决方案。因为祖父是少有的见证殒星的人，他过往的手记提供了不少线索。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902010,"trial_step":10},{"step":10,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"顺便一提，他今年119岁了。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902011,"trial_step":11},{"step":11,"options":["多少？？"],"style":6,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902012,"trial_step":12,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"多少？？","goto":13}]},{"step":12,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"119岁。族曾祖父马上要到双甲子了。他毕竟是恒云堂创始人，养生有方，即使在东洲也算相当高寿的。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902013,"trial_step":13},{"step":13,"content":"你顿时对这位老人和他的医药集团充满敬意。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"感谢你们提供的背景信息，那对我们的行动确实有极大帮助。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"您客气了，族曾祖父是位念旧的人。他以前常跟我们讲起年轻时游玩的庙会，许愿的花神，这些在如今的东洲已经不常见了，毕竟天灾还是会妨碍交通。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902016,"trial_step":16},{"step":16,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"所以，千年紫藤花神重现狄斯城的消息让我们都很激动，连族曾祖父都在恍惚间来了精神。他很希望能来看看，也很高兴我们能帮上忙。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902017,"trial_step":17},{"step":17,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"再后来，听说花神留下，被证明是禁闭者，在尽力恢复中。我们自然也想来出一份力。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这么说——你们知道有什么办法能帮她？","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902019,"trial_step":19},{"step":19,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"正是。我已经去封锁区看过了，但听说还有重要的一部分被局长带了回来……","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902020,"trial_step":20},{"step":20,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"是的，请跟我来。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902021,"trial_step":21},{"step":21,"content":"【场景切换，局长办公室】","style":18,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902022,"trial_step":22},{"step":22,"content":"你带众人来到自己的办公室，端起了摆在桌上的紫藤花枝，简单说明情况。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"以前我通过这个花枝能联系到她的精神，偶尔聊几句——虽然不知道其中原理，但听她说起一些我不知道的东洲实情，我想那不是自己的幻觉。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"可是最近，连这个联系也变弱了。我这几天都没能见到她，花枝的生长也陷入停滞，封锁区也没有任何动静……这令人不安。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"content":"——差不多就是从她上次赶你出去开始，无论你怎么接触，都无法找到萦萦。","style":18,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902026,"trial_step":26},{"step":26,"content":"如果她只是赌气不想要你的元气那还好，可你更担心另一头会不会出了什么意外，让她再也无法回应你。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"speaker":"老人","content":"…………","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"content":"在你陷入苦恼时，老人的目光震颤了一下。他有些激动地拉住紫衣衣角，颤巍巍地指着自己的随身行李。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"我明白，爷爷。交给我吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902031,"trial_step":31},{"step":30,"content":"魏紫衣把一个小坛子从随身行李中拿出来，立刻将手中的坛子盖打开，显露出里面的东西。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902032,"trial_step":32},{"step":31,"content":"——那是一抔黄土。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902033,"trial_step":33},{"step":32,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"请将这些土更换进去，看看情况。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902034,"trial_step":34},{"step":33,"speaker":"选项","options":["试一试吧"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902035,"trial_step":35,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"试一试吧","goto":36}]},{"step":34,"content":"魏紫衣点点头，随行的人员中走出了一位学者模样的人。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902036,"trial_step":36},{"step":35,"content":"他小心翼翼地打开了装着萦萦花枝的玻璃罩子，掏出工具将旧盆栽的土倒了一部分出来。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902037,"trial_step":37},{"step":36,"content":"盆中换上了来自东洲的土壤，完成后用水浇透。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902038,"trial_step":38},{"step":37,"content":"实际上，不需要看仪器上的显示，你的枷锁已经率先有了反应。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902039,"trial_step":39},{"step":38,"content":"原本虚弱的、仿佛下一刻就要消失的气息似乎被唤醒了一般，与你紧密相连。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902040,"trial_step":40},{"step":39,"content":"花枝散发出淡淡的狂厄气息。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902041,"trial_step":41},{"step":40,"content":"它慢慢覆盖了整个办公室，紧接着——","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902042,"trial_step":42},{"step":41,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"……起效果了么？","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902043,"trial_step":43},{"step":42,"content":"伴随着清冽的花香，在场的每个人都似乎听到了紫藤花神温柔的声音。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902044,"trial_step":44},{"step":43,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"呵呵……我闻到了故乡的气息，你们是……东洲人？","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902045,"trial_step":45},{"step":44,"speaker":"萦萦","content":"真是好久不见了，就由这紫藤花当作见面礼，祝愿你们平安顺遂吧~","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902046,"trial_step":46},{"step":45,"content":"众人齐聚的会客室中，竟然不知从何处飘来了紫藤花瓣，纷纷扬扬地落在每一个人的肩头。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902047,"trial_step":47},{"step":46,"content":"同行的人还在惊讶，魏紫衣拈起了自己肩上的紫藤花瓣，放回到你手中的花盆中。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902048,"trial_step":48},{"step":47,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"——就是这样。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902049,"trial_step":49},{"step":48,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"局长，东洲一直有关于“水土”的说法。俗话说，橘生淮南则为橘，生于淮北则为枳。意思就是相同的事物会因为在不同的环境中产生不同的结局。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902050,"trial_step":50},{"step":49,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"地域辽阔，南方的水果带去北方尚不能活。如今到了狄斯，想来是水土问题让萦萦陷入了极致的虚弱。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902051,"trial_step":51},{"step":50,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"不止是水文和土壤，这儿的文化、人、饮食、药方、甚至黑环附近狂厄环境的差异——这些都成了放慢恢复速度的原因。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902052,"trial_step":52},{"step":51,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"恰好祖父有一个习惯，离家之时一定会带上一坛故乡的土壤，以解思乡之情。也能在此时证实我们的猜想。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902053,"trial_step":53},{"step":52,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"只是……这也只是一捧土而已，远远不够。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902054,"trial_step":54},{"step":53,"content":"她注视着花枝，眉头紧锁。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902055,"trial_step":55},{"step":54,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"萦萦来自东洲，她的故乡、她体内流淌的血脉也都是东洲的，也因此，东洲的水土会更适宜她的身体。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902056,"trial_step":56},{"step":55,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"如果留在狄斯城，或许她不会死，但可能几年几十年过去，她也不会有好转。不如让我们将她带回东洲，也许更有希望。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902057,"trial_step":57},{"step":56,"speaker":"选项","options":["等等！"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902058,"trial_step":58,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"等等！","goto":59}]},{"step":57,"content":"所有人目光投向你，你叫停了讨论，却突然不知自己该接什么。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902059,"trial_step":59},{"step":58,"content":"短暂沉默后，你接上话。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902060,"trial_step":60},{"step":59,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"东洲路途遥远，带她回去会面对很大的风险，必须有更全面可靠的论证。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902061,"trial_step":61},{"step":60,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"关于萦萦……她是目前已知还在人世的最早的禁闭者，一百年来经历过很多狂厄环境，她很重要，狄斯非常重视她。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902062,"trial_step":62},{"step":61,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你说的水土也好、狂厄环境也好，得有更多资料才能证明。包括转移期间对她的保护、各种风险防控、还有她本人体内的狂厄要如何控制……","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902063,"trial_step":63},{"step":62,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"对，她需要枷锁帮助稳定狂厄，她留在这里也是有原因的。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902064,"trial_step":64},{"step":63,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"抱歉，这听起来可能会有些苛刻，但萦萦对我……对这个城邦、甚至整个人类来说都非常重要，我认为做到这种程度是必须的。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902065,"trial_step":65},{"step":64,"content":"你都不知道自己说了什么，但只觉得，一定要这么说。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902066,"trial_step":66},{"step":65,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"……您说得很有道理。这些内容确实也都需要写入方案当中，我们还有很多功课要补做。只是在那之前，请原谅我冒昧问一句：","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902067,"trial_step":67},{"step":66,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"您是否不信任我们？","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902068,"trial_step":68},{"step":67,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"因为狄斯的管理者们认为东洲人别有所图，您才这么提防我们吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902069,"trial_step":69},{"step":68,"speaker":"选项","options":["要听听萦萦本人怎么说"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902070,"trial_step":70,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"要听听萦萦本人怎么说","goto":71}]},{"step":69,"content":"你指了指手中的花枝，这句话大概是最不心虚的一句。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902071,"trial_step":71},{"step":70,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"我明白了，今天就到这里吧，我们马上回去完善方案，继续跟您商讨。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902072,"trial_step":72},{"step":71,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"我们怀抱十二分的诚意来，这也是祖父多年来坚持的愿望。如果有任何方法能证明我们的诚意，我们都愿意做。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902073,"trial_step":73},{"step":72,"speaker":"紫衣","content":"我们真诚希望她能康复，回到故乡。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902074,"trial_step":74},{"step":73,"content":"……你很难怀疑他们的诚意。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902075,"trial_step":75},{"step":74,"content":"但是，一想到萦萦也会离开狄斯，你就感到心下一阵无理由的空洞与不安。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902076,"trial_step":76},{"step":75,"content":"你自己也搞不懂为什么。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902077,"trial_step":77},{"step":76,"speaker":"老人","content":"你并不是不信……也不是太小心……","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902078,"trial_step":78},{"step":77,"content":"就在离开的时候，老人开口了。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902079,"trial_step":79},{"step":78,"content":"他的声音嘶哑空洞，像是跨越了无数岁月。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902080,"trial_step":80},{"step":79,"speaker":"老人","content":"只是……不想和她分开罢了。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902081,"trial_step":81},{"step":80,"speaker":"选项","options":["……我不是——"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902082,"trial_step":82,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……我不是——","goto":83}]},{"step":81,"speaker":"老人","content":"我明白，我都明白……可你又能等多久呢？萦萦她……又能等多久？","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902083,"trial_step":83},{"step":82,"speaker":"老人","content":"要等到你老去，垂死……还只对着那盆新芽说……“再等等”吗……","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902084,"trial_step":84},{"step":83,"content":"他用那双仿佛已经看透了一切时光的双眼注视着你。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902085,"trial_step":85},{"step":84,"speaker":"老人","content":"一生……太短了……不趁现在，跑起来，很有可能……就到不了想去的地方了……","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902086,"trial_step":86},{"step":85,"content":"他的话语和目光像是一柄巨锤，重重锤在你的心口。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902087,"trial_step":87},{"step":86,"content":"老人咳嗽着重新躺了下去，闭上了眼睛。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902088,"trial_step":88},{"step":87,"content":"你目送魏氏一行人离开了MBCC，再次端详手中的花枝。然而像是刚才的那一瞬间显灵耗尽了她所有的力量一样，花枝再次陷入了沉默。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902089,"trial_step":89},{"step":88,"content":"当天夜晚","style":9,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902091,"trial_step":91},{"step":89,"speaker":"无患子","content":"“水土治疗”？嗯……倒也没错，也有东洲人相信这种说法。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902092,"trial_step":92},{"step":90,"speaker":"无患子","content":"他们出门在外要自己带够几个月的干粮，无论是吃的还是喝的，初到别的地方肯定不适应。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902093,"trial_step":93},{"step":91,"speaker":"无患子","content":"一些知天命的老人远行时，还会带一坛故乡的黄土在身边，不仅能缓解水土不服的症状，遇到意外也能当落叶归根。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902094,"trial_step":94},{"step":92,"speaker":"无患子","content":"那老爷子挺实在的，都这把年纪了，还大老远跑来见一面紫藤，更是把宝贵的土壤都给了你，嗯……是个好人吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902095,"trial_step":95},{"step":93,"speaker":"无患子","content":"橘生淮南为橘，淮北则为枳，所处之地不同，土地与风雨之类的自然规律便也不一样，生长出的植物也有很大差别。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902096,"trial_step":96},{"step":94,"speaker":"无患子","content":"紫藤生长必须的要素是土壤、水分、空气和阳光。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902097,"trial_step":97},{"step":95,"speaker":"无患子","content":"这座城离东洲太远了，土壤自然也有所不同。那紫藤不适应也很正常。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902098,"trial_step":98},{"step":96,"speaker":"选项","options":["你怎么不早说。"],"style":6,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902099,"trial_step":99,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你怎么不早说。","goto":100}]},{"step":97,"speaker":"无患子","content":"说了又能怎样？你又舍不得她走。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902100,"trial_step":100},{"step":98,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902101,"trial_step":101},{"step":99,"speaker":"无患子","content":"不过你白天拒绝那些人也没错，毕竟风险太大了。要不要采用这个水土疗法还得看萦萦自己，你问她了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902102,"trial_step":102},{"step":100,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……她现在没办法理我。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902103,"trial_step":103},{"step":101,"content":"自从白天那一次的相会之后，紫藤花枝失去了所有反应，只有移栽到东洲土壤上的时候才有了一点复苏的迹象。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902104,"trial_step":104},{"step":102,"speaker":"无患子","content":"那是有点严重……但无论如何，你放心吧，有我在呢，肯定让她死不了。只是……咳，醒过来的时间，确实有那么些不可控。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902105,"trial_step":105},{"step":103,"content":"这些天，无患子在千年紫藤的树根各处都打好了穴洞，以药物进行灌溉。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902106,"trial_step":106},{"step":104,"content":"正是这些药物的滋养，以及日常你输送给萦萦的元气，千年紫藤才勉强维持着活力。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902107,"trial_step":107},{"step":105,"options":["需要面对现实了。"],"style":6,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902108,"trial_step":108,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"需要面对现实了。","goto":109}]},{"step":106,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我最后再问一个问题。抛开一切主观要素，你告诉我，是否让她回到东洲，会更好地恢复？","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902109,"trial_step":109},{"step":107,"speaker":"无患子","content":"你要这么问我的话。是的，我肯定。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902110,"trial_step":110},{"step":108,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……我知道了。谢谢你。","options":["101"],"style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902111,"trial_step":111},{"step":109,"content":"【场景切换，MBCC门口】","style":18,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902112,"trial_step":112},{"step":110,"content":"回到MBCC门口，你却见到夜莺迎面匆匆地走了过来。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902113,"trial_step":113},{"step":111,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长！魏小姐刚刚致电管理局，希望我们能尽快派人去东洲会馆。","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902114,"trial_step":114},{"step":112,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"萦萦和魏老先生，一起失踪了！","voice":["vo_trial_50902_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_yingying_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":150902115,"trial_step":115}]}